Package: nimbusos-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenPGP keys of the NimbusOS archive
 The NimbusOS APT repository is signed with the keys in this package. apt
 uses this keyring (Signed-By in /etc/apt/sources.list.d/nimbusos.sources)
 to verify every NimbusOS update, and nimbus-update uses it to verify the
 signed release notes.
 .
 During a key rotation the package contains both the old and the new key.
